abstract: "Artificial light sources for Cherenkov-telescope simulations: flashers, illuminators, lasers, LEDs and stars, emitting photons at sky, telescope-sphere, telescope or camera level, as a standard-library-only C++20 core with a Python API writing gstrickd photon streams."
